天ノ崎稜奈 Izuna Amanosaki</songwriter><songwriter>井上拓郎 Takuro Inoue</songwriter><songwriter>原明海 Akimi Hara</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:11.724"><div begin="2.454" end="3:11.724"><p begin="2.454" end="4.244" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.454" end="2.799">ね</span><span begin="2.799" end="3.340">え</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3.340" end="3.515">き</span></span></span><span begin="3.515" end="3.668">こ</span><span begin="3.668" end="3.867">え</span><span begin="3.867" end="4.244">る？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">喂 你听到了吗</span></p><p begin="4.381" end="9.365" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4.381" end="5.295">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4.381" end="5.295">ぜ</span></span></span><span begin="5.295" end="5.507">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">声</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5.507" end="5.826">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5.507" end="5.826">え</span></span></span><span begin="5.826" end="6.278">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="6.278" end="6.662">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="6.278" end="6.662">も</span></span></span><span begin="6.662" end="6.851">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="6.851" end="9.365">で</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">风的声音与回忆</span></p><p begin="10.290" end="14.185" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過去</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.290" end="11.260">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.290" end="11.260">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.290" end="11.260">う</span></span></span><span begin="11.260" end="11.464">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="11.464" end="11.781">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="11.464" end="11.781">み</span></span></span><span begin="11.781" end="12.258">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">未来</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.258" end="13.177">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.258" end="13.177">す</span></span></span><span begin="13.177" end="13.429">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">連</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="13.429" end="13.620">つ</span></span></span><span begin="13.620" end="13.768">れ</span><span begin="13.768" end="14.185">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">带着过去的你与未来</span></p><p begin="14.278" end="17.351" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.278" end="14.812">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.278" end="14.812">び</span></span></span><span begin="14.812" end="15.945">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.945" end="16.192">で</span></span></span><span begin="16.192" end="16.873">よ</span><span begin="16.873" end="17.351">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一起踏上旅途吧</span></p><p begin="18.192" end="21.879" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">蒼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="18.192" end="18.804">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="18.192" end="18.804">お</span></span></span><span begin="18.804" end="19.140">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">森</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.140" end="19.428">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.140" end="19.428">り</span></span></span><span begin="19.428" end="20.046">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.046" end="20.381">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.046" end="20.381">め</span></span></span><span begin="20.381" end="21.108">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.108" end="21.689">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.108" end="21.689">か</span></span></span><span begin="21.689" end="21.879">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">苍翠森林的梦境里</span></p><p begin="21.946" end="25.308" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">消</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.946" end="22.161">き</span></span></span><span begin="22.161" end="22.392">え</span><span begin="22.392" end="23.169">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">記</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.169" end="23.403">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">憶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.403" end="24.183">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.403" end="24.183">く</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="24.183" end="24.351">だ</span></span></span><span begin="24.351" end="24.486">き</span><span begin="24.486" end="24.662">し</span><span begin="24.662" end="25.308">め</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">拥抱那已然逝去的记忆</span></p><p begin="25.656" end="28.911" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夏</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.656" end="26.193">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.656" end="26.193">つ</span></span></span><span begin="26.193" end="26.352">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.352" end="26.625">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.352" end="26.625">る</span></span></span><span begin="26.625" end="27.030">の</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">星</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="27.030" end="27.294">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="27.030" end="27.294">し</span></span></span><span begin="27.294" end="27.486">た</span><span begin="27.486" end="27.648">ち</span><span begin="27.648" end="28.002">を</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">集</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.002" end="28.332">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.002" end="28.332">つ</span></span></span><span begin="28.332" end="28.473">め</span><span begin="28.473" end="28.626">よ</span><span begin="28.626" end="28.911">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把夏夜的繁星收集起来</span></p><p begin="29.145" end="34.637" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">暗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.145" end="29.598">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.145" end="29.598">ら</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">闇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.598" end="30.189">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.598" end="30.189">み</span></span></span><span begin="30.189" end="30.294">も</span><span begin="30.294" end="30.414">も</span><span begin="30.414" end="31.075">う</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">怖</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.075" end="31.732">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.075" end="31.732">わ</span></span></span><span begin="31.732" end="32.083">く</span><span begin="32.083" end="32.311">な</span><span begin="32.311" end="32.479">い</span><span begin="32.479" end="32.644">よ</span><span begin="32.644" end="34.637">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那黑夜 就便不再令人害怕了吧</span></p><p begin="35.002" end="38.755" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">西</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.002" end="35.737">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.002" end="35.737">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.737" end="37.574">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.737" end="37.574">ぜ</span></span></span> <span begin="37.574" end="37.750">う</span><span begin="37.750" end="38.026">た</span><span begin="38.026" end="38.755">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">西风轻吟</span></p><p begin="39.022" end="42.720" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">星</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.022" end="39.760">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.022" end="39.760">し</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">降</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.760" end="40.018">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="40.018" end="41.547">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">注</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.547" end="42.048">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.547" end="42.048">そ</span></span></span><span begin="42.048" end="42.720">ぐ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">繁星如雨坠落</span></p><p begin="43.243" end="47.323" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.243" end="43.709">そん</span><span begin="43.709" end="43.997">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">当</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.997" end="44.534">あ</span></span></span><span begin="44.534" end="44.741">た</span><span begin="44.741" end="44.993">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">前</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.993" end="45.716">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.993" end="45.716">え</span></span></span><span begin="45.716" end="45.979">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">「奇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.979" end="46.513">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">跡」</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.513" end="46.993">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.513" end="46.993">き</span></span></span><span begin="46.993" end="47.323">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这样习以为常的“奇迹”</span></p><p begin="47.474" end="50.651" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">朝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.474" end="47.921">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.474" end="47.921">さ</span></span></span><span begin="47.921" end="48.122">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">連</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.122" end="48.482">つ</span></span></span><span begin="48.482" end="49.520">れ</span><span begin="49.520" end="49.652">て</span><span begin="49.652" end="49.922">く</span><span begin="49.922" end="50.651">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">正悄悄唤醒晨曦</span></p><p begin="50.912" end="54.728" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">波</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.912" end="51.485">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.912" end="51.485">み</span></span></span><span begin="51.485" end="51.920">し</span><span begin="51.920" end="53.495">ぶ</span><span begin="53.495" end="53.621">き</span><span begin="53.621" end="53.843">あ</span><span begin="53.843" end="54.728">げ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">掀起万重浪花</span></p><p begin="55.104" end="59.251" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.104" end="55.452">ど</span><span begin="55.452" end="55.593">こ</span><span begin="55.593" end="55.743">ま</span><span begin="55.743" end="55.927">で</span><span begin="55.927" end="57.378">も</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="57.378" end="57.888">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="57.378" end="57.888">み</span></span></span><span begin="57.888" end="58.032">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.032" end="58.231">い</span></span></span><span begin="58.231" end="58.414">き</span><span begin="58.414" end="59.028">た</span><span begin="59.028" end="59.251">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论身在何方 我都想与你同行</span></p><p begin="59.884" end="1:08.001" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="59.884" end="1:00.039">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.039" end="1:00.720">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.039" end="1:00.720">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:00.720" end="1:00.882">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.882" end="1:01.875">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.882" end="1:01.875">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.882" end="1:01.875">だ</span></span></span><span begin="1:01.875" end="1:02.052">も</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:02.052" end="1:02.386">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:02.052" end="1:02.386">び</span></span></span><span begin="1:02.386" end="1:03.023">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">証</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.336" end="1:08.001">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.336" end="1:08.001">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.336" end="1:08.001">し</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不管是笑容还是泪水 都是我们每一段旅程的见证</span></p><p begin="1:23.867" end="1:25.617" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.867" end="1:24.204">ね</span><span begin="1:24.204" end="1:24.627">え</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.627" end="1:24.840">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:24.840" end="1:25.014">こ</span><span begin="1:25.014" end="1:25.180">え</span><span begin="1:25.180" end="1:25.617">る？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">喂 你听到了吗</span></p><p begin="1:25.701" end="1:30.786" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.701" end="1:26.667">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.701" end="1:26.667">ぜ</span></span></span><span begin="1:26.667" end="1:26.837">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">声</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:26.837" end="1:27.153">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:26.837" end="1:27.153">え</span></span></span><span begin="1:27.153" end="1:27.668">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:27.668" end="1:28.001">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:27.668" end="1:28.001">も</span></span></span><span begin="1:28.001" end="1:28.157">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span t