2:02.921">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">注</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.921" end="2:03.341">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.921" end="2:03.341">そ</span></span></span><span begin="2:03.341" end="2:04.050">ぐ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">繁星如雨坠落</span></p><p begin="2:04.559" end="2:08.686" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.559" end="2:05.060">そん</span><span begin="2:05.060" end="2:05.340">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">当</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.340" end="2:05.844">あ</span></span></span><span begin="2:05.844" end="2:06.074">た</span><span begin="2:06.074" end="2:06.340">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">前</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.340" end="2:07.012">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.340" end="2:07.012">え</span></span></span><span begin="2:07.012" end="2:07.338">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">「奇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.338" end="2:07.807">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">跡」</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.807" end="2:08.314">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.807" end="2:08.314">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:08.314" end="2:08.686">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这样习以为常的“奇迹”</span></p><p begin="2:08.822" end="2:11.972" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">朝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.822" end="2:09.220">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.822" end="2:09.220">さ</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.220" end="2:09.459">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">連</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.459" end="2:09.830">つ</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.830" end="2:10.824">れ</span><span begin="2:10.824" end="2:11.034">て</span><span begin="2:11.034" end="2:11.258">く</span><span begin="2:11.258" end="2:11.972">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">正悄悄唤醒晨曦</span></p><p begin="2:12.312" end="2:15.949" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">波</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.312" end="2:12.812">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.312" end="2:12.812">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:12.812" end="2:13.294">し</span><span begin="2:13.294" end="2:14.830">ぶ</span><span begin="2:14.830" end="2:14.969">き</span><span begin="2:14.969" end="2:15.198">あ</span><span begin="2:15.198" end="2:15.949">げ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">掀起万重浪花</span></p><p begin="2:16.454" end="2:20.682" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.454" end="2:16.769">ど</span><span begin="2:16.769" end="2:16.916">こ</span><span begin="2:16.916" end="2:17.066">ま</span><span begin="2:17.066" end="2:17.206">で</span><span begin="2:17.206" end="2:18.718">も</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.718" end="2:19.148">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.718" end="2:19.148">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.148" end="2:19.387">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.387" end="2:19.568">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.568" end="2:19.706">き</span><span begin="2:19.706" end="2:20.306">た</span><span begin="2:20.306" end="2:20.682">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论身在何方 都想与你同行</span></p><p begin="2:21.252" end="2:27.383" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.252" end="2:21.402">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.402" end="2:22.060">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.402" end="2:22.060">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.060" end="2:22.326">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.326" end="2:23.212">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.326" end="2:23.212">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.326" end="2:23.212">だ</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.212" end="2:23.404">も</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.404" end="2:23.726">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.404" end="2:23.726">び</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.726" end="2:24.272">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">証</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.692" end="2:27.383">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.692" end="2:27.383">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.692" end="2:27.383">し</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不管是笑容还是泪水 都是我们每一段旅程的见证</span></p><p begin="2:28.123" end="2:31.690" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">灯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.123" end="2:28.840">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.123" end="2:28.840">も</span></span></span><span begin="2:28.840" end="2:29.146">し</span><span begin="2:29.146" end="2:30.567">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">願</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.567" end="2:31.116">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.567" end="2:31.116">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:31.116" end="2:31.690">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">点燃放飞的心愿</span></p><p begin="2:32.160" end="2:35.816" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.160" end="2:32.306">と</span></span></span><span begin="2:32.306" end="2:32.834">ば</span><span begin="2:32.834" end="2:33.125">し</span><span begin="2:33.125" end="2:34.540">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.540" end="2:35.096">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.540" end="2:35.096">ら</span></span></span><span begin="2:35.096" end="2:35.816">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让它飞向浩瀚苍穹</span></p><p begin="2:36.299" end="2:40.455" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.299" end="2:36.776">ホ</span><span begin="2:36.776" end="2:37.094">ラ</span><span begin="2:37.094" end="2:37.503">ガ</span><span begin="2:37.503" end="2:37.813">イ</span><span begin="2:37.813" end="2:38.026">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">残</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.026" end="2:38.600">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.026" end="2:38.600">こ</span></span></span><span begin="2:38.600" end="2:38.744">し</span><span begin="2:38.744" end="2:39.073">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">感</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.073" end="2:39.745">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.073" end="2:39.745">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">情</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.745" end="2:40.455">じょう</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">留存在螺号里的重重悸动</span></p><p begin="2:40.637" end="2:43.753" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">終</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.637" end="2:40.773">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:40.773" end="2:41.043">わ</span><span begin="2:41.043" end="2:41.247">ら</span><span begin="2:41.247" end="2:41.519">な</span><span begin="2:41.519" end="2:42.535">い</span><span begin="2:42.535" end="2:42.703">ス</span><span begin="2:42.703" end="2:43.053">トー</span><span begin="2:43.053" end="2:43.753">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那永不落幕的故事</span></p><p begin="2:44.105" end="2:47.754" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">運</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.105" end="2:44.550">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.105" end="2:44.550">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">命</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.550" end="2:46.523">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.550" end="2:46.523">い</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">越</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.523" end="2:46.689">こ</span></span></span><span begin="2:46.689" end="2:47.045">え</span><span begin="2:47.045" end="2:47.754">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">跨越命运的枷锁</span></p><p begin="2:48.203" end="2:52.826" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.203" end="2:48.493">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:48.493" end="2:48.683">え</span><span begin="2:48.683" end="2:48.959">な</span><span begin="2:48.959" end="2:49.491">かっ</span><span begin="2:49.491" end="2:49.694">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.694" end="2:50.170">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.694" end="2:50.170">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.170" end="2:50.436">ば</span></span></span><span begin="2:50.436" end="2:50.660">を</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.660" end="2:50.950">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:50.950" end="2:51.150">わ</span><span begin="2:51.150" end="2:51.432">せ</span><span begin="2:51.432" end="2:51.682">て</span><span begin="2:51.682" end="2:51.986">ほ</span><span begin="2:51.986" end="2:52.595">し</span><span begin="2:52.595" end="2:52.826">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">请让我说出那句未曾出口的话语</span></p><p begin="2:53.011" end="2:59.786" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.011" end="2:53.187">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">味</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.187" end="2:53.848">み</span></span></span> <span begin="2:53.848" end="2:53.984">な</span><span begin="2:53.984" end="2:54.225">い</span><span begin="2:54.225" end="2:54.704">よ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.180" end="2:55.510">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.180" end="2:55.510">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:55.510" end="2:56.770">が</span> <span begin="2:56.948" end="2:57.119">い</span><span begin="2:57.119" end="2:57.252">な</span><span begin="2:57.252" end="2:57.375">く</span><span begin="2:57.375" end="2:59.786">ちゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果没有你 这一切便会毫无意义</span></p><p begin="3:00.747" end="3:11.724" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.747" end="3:00.909">そ</span><span begin="3:00.909" end="3:01.047">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.047" end="3:01.351">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.047" end="3:01.351">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:01.351" end="3:04.485">が</span> <span begin="3:05.852" end="3:06.027">い</span><span begin="3:06.027" end="3:06.129">な</span><span begin="3:06.129" end="3:06.261">く</span><span begin="3:06.261" end="3:11.724">ちゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果没有你陪伴在身边的话 是这样的</span></p></div></body></tt>